OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 21 MAR
OL,4,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,5,     GTom Service with the perfect
OL,6,     Gclassical soundtrack for the
OL,7,     Gweekend and guests including
OL,8,     Gconductors Yannick Nezet-Seguin
OL,9,     Gand Vasily Petrenko, and composer
OL,10,     GLaura Bowler.
OL,11,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,12,     GJools is joined by the artist
OL,13,     GTracey Emin, with music by Ravel,
OL,14,     GMorricone and Beethoven.
OL,15,G1300FMusic Matters
OL,16,     GMark Radcliffe discusses his
OL,17,     Gfavourite choral music, from his
OL,18,     Gearly exposure to Handel's
OL,19,     GMessiah, through to works by
OL,20,     GGorecki, Tallis and James
OL,21,     GMacMillan.
